Integrating a security scanner like SonarQube or Dependabot into a CI/CD pipeline

SonarQube → static code analysis
OWASP Dependency-Check → open-source dependency
GitHub Dependabot

1. SonarQube Scan Logs
   Logs printed to GitHub Actions console.
   Vulnerabilities and issues will be visible in:
   GitHub logs.
   SonarQube dashboard: https://<your-sonarqube-url>/dashboard?id=myproject

2.OWASP Dependency-Check Output
   /dependency-check-report:
    dependency-check-report.html
    dependency-check-report.json
    dependency-check-report.xml
